  "$description": "Hand-edited, design-owned token source (operator decision Q-A2, 2026-11-09). Values equal what docs/design/prototype renders (assets/km.css plus shared rendered CSS). themes.dark is the complete base set and the default theme; themes.light lists only overrides and inherits every other key from dark, exactly as [data-theme=\"light\"] does in km.css. Each key maps 1:1 to a CSS custom property --<key>. v1.2.0 applied operator decision D-5 (WCAG 2.2 AA contrast fixes). v1.3.0 applies the operator design answers of 2026-11-11 (D-6 Flat 2.0 with no strokes, fill-only control boundaries and fill-based focus; D-7 size tokens; D-8 adaptive layout window classes and layout motion). v1.5.0 applies the operator decision of 2026-11-12: fill-only surface hierarchy, bg -> surface -> card 1.15-1.25:1 in both themes, with the control, text and brand-graphic values that the new levels required (discrepancy-log F5b RV-38..RV-41). Values that intentionally differ from the frozen prototype are listed in discrepancy-log.md sections D and E. Reconciliation log: docs/design/token-reconciliation/README.md.",
